An unlucky critical hit killed a party member;
Drove all the others insane with the stress;
Everyone skipped thier go or did random things;
Party wipe on the 2nd room
10/10 would dig up my mansion again
In all seriousness this is a very good game. The artwork is amazing, the narrator has a voice that sane men would kill for, the gameplay is a challange (dont get attached to your adventurers). The mechanics of the game are nicely set out and very easy to pick up and follow, and it also has unique features in the torch and stress mechanics.
Cons? RNG (Maaan those crits), maybe a bit pricey for some people, my graveyard isnt nearly big enough...

I still recomend this game but I now have realised that due to the constant Creation Club updates, most of my mods dont work making my game crash everytime I;
Eat, Sleep, Use a stimpack on a companion, Fast Travel or generally play the game. Considering the loading times arent great this is just really♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥me off!
£50 for a game plus £30 for DLC and now more for what? Bad Nexus mod ports and constant 'bug fixes' and creation club crap. No thanks

